Revision history for JS::Minifier

{{$NEXT}}

    - Fix drop_console crash on parens/slashes inside string, regex,
      template, and comment arguments
    - Fix drop_debugger dropping debugger in non-statement contexts
      (e.g. obj.debugger, f(debugger))
    - Fix division/regex misclassification: / vs // collisions and
      unterminated regex crashes (a / /re/, /a/ / b, "a" / 2)
    - Fix regex literals inside template ${} interpolation
    - Normalize CRLF (\r\n) input so whitespace collapses and shebangs
      are preserved
    - Anchor strip_debug to line starts so ;;; in strings/comments
      is left alone
    - Treat U+2028/U+2029 as line terminators (end // comments)
    - Performance: ord()-based is-alphanum/is-whitespace/is-endspace
    - Fix crash on empty input
    - Shorten true/false only in value contexts
    - Drop is copy from all sub signatures for performance
    - Replace O(n²) string concat with array join in identifier building
    - Replace fragile given/when Bool smartmatch with plain if/else
    - Fork of JS::Minify by Sam Morrison
    - All-new CLI tool bin/jsminify
    - Add shebang, bang-comment, template literal, NOCOMPRESS support
    - Add drop_console/drop_debugger options
    - Shorten true to !0 and false to !1
    - Remove semicolons before closing braces
    - Multiple bug fixes (out-of-bounds reads, line continuation,
      unterminated string detection, empty-string false positives,
      return/regex misclassification)
